    "Name": "Reptar EPT-C-1",
    "Details": "A Garrison Mech constructed by the newly formed Escorpion Imperio in 3086, the 35 ton Reptar is essentially an up-gunned Industrial Mech. Designed to free up more capable machines for the front lines, the Reptar is usually deployed to protect command posts and other key infrastructure; only entering combat in the events of an emergency or enemy attack. Powered by a 175-rated fuel Cell, the Reptar is armed with a ProtoMech AC/8 and a pair of LMG’s.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.73</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
